dsh-pet-tts README · Routes：The host exposes a prefix route, useful for scripting or a custom frontend:

```
GET /dsh-pet-tts/ping                          → { ok, defaultPreset, presets }
GET /dsh-pet-tts/health                        → { ready, python, edgeTts, dataRoot, venv }
GET /dsh-pet-tts/presets                       → full preset table
GET /dsh-pet-tts/voices                        → every voice Microsoft currently returns
